OL,3,AMore flights delayed after hundreds
OL,4,Acancelled by air traffic control glitch
OL,5,
OL,6,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband said the
OL,7,Foutage was "unacceptable" and Transport
OL,8,FSecretary Heidi Alexander has summoned
OL,9,FRolfe to a meeting to explain what
OL,10,Fhappened.
